Short:    joystick library
Uploader: cordierfr@wanadoo.fr (Frédéric Cordier)
Author:   cordierfr@wanadoo.fr (Frédéric Cordier)
Type:     util/libs

It's a short library that can use give you the state of any
joystick in port 0 and 1.
 - It can detect 3 differents fire buttons.
 - It can give you what direction is selectionned on joysticks.
